  "notes": [
   {
    "id": 4185658913,
    "type": "DiffNote",
    "body": "The table-building block now has four near-identical branches (descendants × show-id), each with its own header and row loop. Adding another column means editing four places. Build the header and each row once, with the Owner cell inserted conditionally, instead of repeating the loop four times. That also removes the second copy of the old group branch that this change left in place.",
